"></span></span> with many successful patents. He worked with Thomas Jefferson on the polygraph which was a desk that could be used for copying a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>. He wrote academic papers on different subjects and tried to make movies, spectacles and a velocipede (a kind of <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>). Peale was also a naturalist and taxidermist and he helped unearth the skeleton of a mastodon which was the best <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in his museum.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":4}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ielts-simulation-tests-academic-listening-test-7-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-q1","part_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-p1","group_id":"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-g1-0","question_type":"multiple_choice","ieltsQuestionType":"multiple_choice_single","question_text":"","correct_answer":"C","correct_answer_variants":["C"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3219389_1","order_index":1,"points":1,"sourceOptions":[{"value":"A","text":"Aexclusively for tax administration."},{"value":"B","text":"Bexclusively by individual tax payers."},{"value":"C","text":"Cfor managing several government services."}]},{"id":"en-ielts-simulation-t7-l-q2","part_id":"en-ielts